# Kubernetes deployment

The base contains a Deployment, ClusterIP Service, ServiceAccount, ConfigMap,
PodDisruptionBudget, NetworkPolicy, health probes, resource bounds, and a hardened
container security context.

Copy `secret.example.yaml` outside version control or integrate your existing
secret controller. Set the immutable image in an overlay, then inspect:

```sh
kubectl kustomize deploy/kubernetes/base
```

The selected PostgreSQL authority is external; this pack does not install a
database operator into an existing cluster.
